    "doc": {
      "text_zh": "编号: A-0013\n版级: 熔版 / Fusum\n发现地点: [已编辑]\n\n单次铭刻事件中记录到连锁激活现象。D-████报告'所有铅字同时鸣响，如雷暴过境'。现场留下熔蜡痕迹，圣坛表面出现未知刻痕。\n\n警告: 仅限VII级以上人员接触。使用前需填写F-017事件预案表。",
      "text_en": "Item: A-0013\nClass: Fusum\nOrigin: [REDACTED]\n\nChain activation events recorded during single inscription incidents. Subject D-████ reported 'all keys rang at once, like thunder passing through'. Scene contained molten residue and unknown markings on lectern surface.\n\nWarning: Level VII clearance required. Complete F-017 incident plan before use."
    }
