      "text_en": "🔔 Before this crystal, malign inscriptions lose their sting\n────\n📄 Designation: P-2██ \"Residual Anomaly Dampener\"\nGradus: Fixum\nOrigin: Transitional Era protective measures\n\nAll residual anomaly negative effects demonstrate measurable attenuation. Subject D-████ noted \"the twisted glyphs no longer seared the eyes so.\" Statistical reduction in anomaly-related injury incidents during possession. Device surface bears unknown crystalline film, warm to touch.\n\nNote: Crystal analysis inconclusive. Sample pulverized upon removal."
