      "text_zh": "慈悲如蜡，软化严苛的铜制法度。引擎之门槛因怜悯而降——但恩典亦有其代价。",
      "text_en": "Mercy flows like wax, softening harsh bronze law. The Engine's gate yields to compassion—yet grace carries its own price."
